flowchart TB
    Staff[Platform Admin / Support / Security] --> Console[Central CRM Operator Console]
    Console --> Gateway[Restricted Admin API Gateway]

    Gateway --> Identity[Platform Identity and Session Service]
    Identity --> MFA[Real MFA / Passkeys / Step-up]
    Identity --> SSO[SSO / OIDC Integration Boundary]
    Gateway --> Policy[Policy Engine / Least Privilege]
    Policy <--> RBAC[(Authoritative Platform RBAC)]
    Policy --> Decision{Authorized?}
    Decision -->|No| Deny[Deny + Security Event]
    Decision -->|Yes| Ops[Platform Operations API]

    Ops --> Tenant[Provisioning Orchestrator]
    Ops --> Support[Support / Case Workflow]
    Ops --> Security[Security Incident Workflow]
    Ops --> Billing[Billing / Subscriptions]
    Ops --> Entitlements[Plans / Feature Entitlements]
    Ops --> Flags[Feature Rollout / Kill Switch]
    Ops --> Impersonation[Approved Tenant-Scoped Delegation]
    Ops --> Infra[Infrastructure / Health]

    Tenant --> Registry[(Platform Registry DB)]
    Billing --> Registry
    Entitlements --> Registry
    Flags --> Registry
    Impersonation --> ClientAPI[Client CRM APIs / Normal Client Policies]
    Tenant --> TenantStores[(Isolated Tenant Data Plane)]

    Ops --> Verify[Verify Operation Outcome]
    Verify --> Audit[Durable Tamper-Evident Audit]
    Audit --> AuditStore[(Restricted Audit Store)]
    Gateway -. Request traces .-> Obs[Logs / Metrics / Traces / SLOs]
    Ops -. Service telemetry .-> Obs
    Security --> Incident[Incident Classification / Escalation / Reporting]
    Obs --> Incident

    Compliance[Data Inventory / Purpose / Consent / Retention / Rights] --> Registry
    Compliance --> ClientAPI
    Docs[Private Document Service / Encryption / Scanning / Temporary Links] --> TenantStores
    Docs --> Compliance

    Obs --> AI[Permission-Filtered Read-Only AI Copilot]
    Incident --> AI
    AI --> Review[Human Review / Approval]
    Review -. Approved actions return through normal policy .-> Policy
